   "annotation_type": "footnote",
   "annotation_text": "Pharmacogenetic sample (1 per patient for the entire study) may be obtained from randomized patients at any time between Visit 2 (Baseline) and Visit 6 (Week 6). To be omitted if sampling is not possible due to remote visits being completed.",
   "marker_locations": [
    {
